# Icon sizes

Every `@pond/icons` glyph is one scalable drawing. Set the size with the `size` prop. There are no size packs.

## Do

```tsx
import { IconXmark } from "@pond/icons";

<IconXmark size={12} />
```

- Default `size` is 18. Use 12 for compact UI (chips, dense rows, tight icon buttons).
- The stroke is a fixed 1.25px at every size up to 18, and stays exact when CSS resizes the icon. Icons take no `strokeWidth` prop. Every icon shares one weight.

## Don't

```tsx
<IconXmark width={10} height={10} />
<IconXmark style={{ transform: "scale(0.6)" }} />
<IconXmark strokeWidth={2} />
```

## Missing glyph

Draw it under `packages/icons/svg/` and run `pnpm --filter @pond/icons generate`. Do not pull icons from another set.
